block: add a bio_endio_status helper

jira KERNEL-1864
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-6.12.0-264.7.1.el10_3
commit-author Christoph Hellwig <hch@lst.de>
commit a7d8eaee7fafe2e2c58aef9579bdef778c144029
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-6.12.0-264.7.1.el10_3/a7d8eaee.failed

Add a helper that sets bi_status and call bio_endio() as that is a very
common pattern and convert the core block code over to it.

	Signed-off-by: Christoph Hellwig <hch@lst.de>
	Reviewed-by: Keith Busch <kbusch@kernel.org>
	Reviewed-by: Md Haris Iqbal <haris.iqbal@linux.dev>
	Reviewed-by: Damien Le Moal <dlemoal@kernel.org>
	Reviewed-by: Hannes Reinecke <hare@kernel.org>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260528084632.2505277-1-hch@lst.de
	Signed-off-by: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
(cherry picked from commit a7d8eaee7fafe2e2c58aef9579bdef778c144029)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

